(7550725, 1209756, 112739, '<td valign="top">The leading lines cannot be ignored or forgotten as your mind attempts to reconcile what might happen when the next few steps are taken. The whimsical notion of protection from an umbrella is preposterous in the face of the cold unknown. My highest scoring image this month.</td>', 'The leading lines cannot be ignored or forgotten as your mind attempts to reconcile what might happen when the next few steps are taken. The whimsical notion of protection from an umbrella is preposterous in the face of the cold unknown. My highest scoring image this month.', '2018-01-02 14:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
