(7550734, 1209812, 112739, '<td valign="top">I''ve never had the pleasure or fortune to witness the lights, but I have seen many images of them. This image works well for the most part. I feel it''s a little washed out and could use a little contrast in the color regions. I would think getting the shutter speed and ISO to balance is a challenge in these conditions. I have no idea now long the shutter would even need to stay open for this event. Overall, a good image to be proud of. I like the space you left around the snowy spots on the ice.</td>', 'I''ve never had the pleasure or fortune to witness the lights, but I have seen many images of them. This image works well for the most part. I feel it''s a little washed out and could use a little contrast in the color regions. I would think getting the shutter speed and ISO to balance is a challenge in these conditions. I have no idea now long the shutter would even need to stay open for this event. Overall, a good image to be proud of. I like the space you left around the snowy spots on the ice.', '2018-01-02 14:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
